# The last people, from a normal start. Seed 1 wakes beside Oyster Row: walk
# up toward the square with the real keys, wait to see a villager dressed for
# the coast and their trade, and walk up to one. Watch the village into the
# evening (rims at dusk, the lantern lit with its key and the slate on the
# wrist marking the player), everyone indoors at night and out at dawn. Then
# the villages of the other lands, each dressed for its own weather.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/characters.tour --seed=1
coast calm
wait 1.0
shot 01-wake
walk 1,-1 0.9
await folk 6
wait 0.4
shot 02-oyster-row
walkto folk 12
zoom 5
wait 0.4
shot 03-a-villager-close
zoom 9
walk -1,-0.3 1.3
wait 0.6
shot 04-villagers-and-the-dog
hour 19.6
wait 2.5
shot 05-dusk
hour 20.7
wait 2.0
tap lamp
wait 1.0
zoom 5
shot 06-lantern-slate-and-rims
zoom 9
hour 21.02
wait 12
shot 07-indoors
hour 5.6
wait 3
shot 08-dawn
# The other lands: teleports, then the same wait and walk to someone.
hour 11
zoom 12
village 10
await folk 8
walkto folk 12
zoom 6
wait 0.5
shot 09-snowfield-hush-fold
zoom 12
village 6
await folk 8
walkto folk 12
zoom 6
wait 0.5
shot 10-burning-cinderstead
zoom 12
village 1
await folk 8
walkto folk 12
zoom 6
wait 0.5
shot 11-moss-fennick
